// Deliberately OUTSIDE every declared source: a same-named type that must never be confused with the
// workspace's `Gear`, and must never appear in its references. This is what `source`/`projects` buy.
// A file in a loose build's ROOT is in no module, so it is file-private (design/module-system.md §2e.27).

type value Gear {
    public int32 teeth;
}
